'''''Star Wars: The Clone Wars'' The Complete Season One''' is a three-disc Blu-ray or four-disc DVD box set of the [[2008]]&ndash;[[2009]] [[The Clone Wars: Season One|first season]] of the ''[[Star Wars: The Clone Wars]]'' television series. It was first released by [[Warner Bros.|Warner Home Video]] on [[November 3]], 2009.

==Contents==
The set includes:

*All 22 Episodes of Season One;
*7 Director's Cut Episodes: "[[Rising Malevolence|Rising ''Malevolence'']]," "[[Shadow of Malevolence|Shadow of ''Malevolence'']]," "[[Lair of Grievous]]," "[[Rookies (episode)|Rookies]]," "[[Storm Over Ryloth]]," "[[Innocents of Ryloth]]," and "[[Liberty on Ryloth]]";
*22 Behind-the-Scenes featurettes of each episode with director and crew interviews;
*An exclusive 68-page production journal with original sketches and artist notes;
*The "Jedi Temple Archives" feature exclusive to the Blu-ray version.

The DVD version includes some hidden [[easter egg]]s:

*Disc One&mdash;[[The Clone Wars: Season Two]] trailer;
*Disc Two&mdash;''[[Star Wars: The Clone Wars: Republic Heroes]]'' trailer;
*Disc Three&mdash;Behind-the-Scenes video of animation, models, animations, and sketches;
*Disc Four&mdash;video Ad for [[StarWars.com]], Star Wars Shop, and the [[Star Wars: Blogs]].

